OL,3,GNEWSAMan rammed tractor into house in
OL,4,Agrave attack feud
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who rammed a stolen tractor into
OL,7,Fa family's home amid a feud with their
OL,8,Fson over a desecrated grave has been
OL,9,Fjailed for more than seven years.
OL,11,FNathan Blagg, 28, stole the #30,000
OL,12,FMassey Ferguson from a farm near Yarm
OL,13,Fand smashed it into a house nine miles
OL,14,F(14.5km) away in Middlesbrough in the
OL,15,Fearly hours of 9 May, Teesside Crown
OL,16,FCourt heard.
OL,18,FThe homeowners said they lived in
OL,19,Fongoing fear of more attacks, while the
OL,20,Ffarmer said his livelihood was hard
OL,21,Fenough without people stealing his
OL,22,Fequipment.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
